---
title: 看诊全流程
---
%% 图示原文结构：顾客 · AlphaHerb · 店员/药剂师 · 中医师 · HerbMan %%
flowchart TB
  subgraph cust["顾客"]
    direction TB
    enter[进店]
  end

  subgraph ah["AlphaHerb"]
    direction TB
    gait[/步态扫描：生成行为画像/]
    face[/人脸识别/]
    dec{是否新客户?}
    assist[/辅助问诊：诊疗会话、辅助诊断、智能荐方/]
  end

  subgraph clerk["店员/药剂师"]
    direction TB
    newcust[基础询问、建档、到诊]
    recv[接待、到诊]
    pay[收款]
    disp[配药发药]
  end

  subgraph doc["中医师"]
    direction TB
    seen[接诊：问诊、中医四诊、诊断、开方]
  end

  subgraph hm["HerbMan"]
    direction TB
    arch[(档案存储)]
    record[(诊疗记录存储)]
    stock[(更新药品库存)]
  end

  enter --> gait
  enter --> face

  face --> dec
  gait -->|数据融合| arch

  dec -->|是| newcust
  dec -->|否| recv

  newcust --> arch
  newcust --> recv

  recv --> seen
  recv --> assist

  seen --> record
  seen --> pay

  pay --> disp
  disp --> stock

  assist -->|AI分析、辅助问诊| seen
